WEBVTT

00:03:58.436 --> 00:04:01.796
Either I can call someone on the phone
or it's somebody I live with.

00:04:01.836 --> 00:04:04.876
I can literally feel my body calm down.

00:04:04.876 --> 00:04:09.396
I can feel that fight or flight
response subside.

00:04:10.396 --> 00:04:13.076
But what if I don't have
anybody to go home to?

00:04:13.116 --> 00:04:15.516
What if there's nobody I can call?

00:04:16.396 --> 00:04:21.676
What we find is that people
who are isolated, are lonely,

00:04:21.716 --> 00:04:27.196
don't have those stress regulators
that we get from good relationships

00:04:27.236 --> 00:04:31.716
and that we stay in chronic
fight or flight mode,